  dialogueLines:
  - 
  - You wake up from what feels like the worst nap of your life.
  - Your head is pounding.
  - "And you can\u2019t tell where you are."
  - 'Slowly, you start to get up. '
  - As you do, you realise that you are in what appears to be a glass cage.
  - "\u201CWhat the\u2026\u201D"
  - 'You pound on the glass. '
  - 'The chains attached to your wrists rattle as you do. '
  - "\u201CHello!?\u201D"
  - You slam harder.
  - "\u201CIs anyone there!?\u201D"
  - 'A small screen turns on in the corner of your eye. '
